.TH VAUTH-UI 1 "September 2026" "vAuth 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vauth-ui \- graphical interaction agent for vAuth
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vauth-ui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vauth-ui
is the unprivileged graphical interaction agent for the vAuth virtual FIDO2
authenticator. It registers with the vAuth daemon on the system D-Bus and
displays requests for user presence and user verification.
.PP
The agent must run inside the active local login session. It remains hidden
until the daemon sends an interaction request. Closing an active interaction
window cancels that interaction; otherwise the program continues waiting for
later requests.
.PP
The UI agent does not authenticate users itself. Passwords are passed through
a bounded, one-shot file descriptor to the daemon's PAM verifier and are
discarded after submission.
.SH OPTIONS
This program accepts no command-line options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vauthctl (1)
